5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,We need to be methodical about this. Let's start by identifying the financial and logistical risks before we suggest any destinations.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shion,,I agree. A destination is just a name until you know the actual conditions of the stay. We should prioritize the quality of the environment.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minato,,I want everyone to be happy! I'm worried about how much work it takes to organize everything. Let's see what the workload looks like.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Misaki,,We must ensure the budget is accurate this time. I want to see exactly where the money goes to avoid any deficits.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"We need a place that actually brings us together! If we just do the same old thing, the year-groups will never mix.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Takumi, bonding is important, but not at the cost of fairness. I want to look into how we handle the fees and cancellations.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Minato, workload is one thing, but if the members are exhausted from poor sleep, the training is pointless. I'll check the actual living conditions.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Minato,,"@Asuka, that makes sense. I'll look into the booking processes and the duties involved in running the camp.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Misaki,,I'll focus on the transport costs and the terms for renting buildings. Those are usually where the hidden expenses hide.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Takumi,,I'll check what the seniors think about mixing and see who actually attends the camps. We need a place people actually want to go to.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I'll also check the rate sheets for public beds to get a baseline for costs.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shion,,I'll look into the accounts of other clubs that went inland to see if those facilities are actually viable.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Minato,,I'll check the cooking duties from last year. I don't want the organizers to be too tired to train.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Misaki,,I'll stick with the transport receipts and the quoting terms for lets.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Takumi,,I'll look at the attendance sheets and the seniors' advice on mixing.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
