60,3,1,talk,Asuka,,"Option A is a public facility, which means the lottery nightmare Minato mentioned. Option B is on campus, and Option C is a distant lodge.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Shion,,"Option A's shared dorms are likely the ""eight to a room"" scenario I feared. Option B is safe for sleep, but Option C is a gamble.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Minato,,"Option A has that terrible application process. Option B is easy to organize, but Option C's meals are handled by the owner, which is a plus.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Misaki,,Option C is a financial disaster waiting to happen. High transport costs and non-refundable deposits for a whole building? Absolutely not.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Takumi,,"Option B is the worst for bonding. If people go home or stay separately, the year-groups won't mix at all. Option A or C is better.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Takumi, Option C's financial risk is too high. If someone drops out, the rest of us pay. Option B is the only fiscally responsible choice.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Shion,,"@Takumi, Option A is a recipe for sleep deprivation. I cannot support a place where we are packed in like sardines. I prefer Option B.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Minato,,"@Asuka, I agree. Option B removes the stress of the lottery and the cooking duties. It's the most peaceful choice for the organizers.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Takumi, I understand the bonding issue, but we can't afford a deficit. Option B is the only one that guarantees we stay within budget.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Misaki, if we choose Option B, we're just admitting the club is drifting apart. But I can't argue with the money.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Asuka,,"Since we all agree that Option A is a logistical mess and Option C is a financial risk, Option B is the logical conclusion.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Shion,,It's the only option that ensures we aren't exhausted by the environment. I'm voting for B.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Minato,,It's the kindest option for the people doing the work. I vote for Option B.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Misaki,,It's the only responsible choice for the club's accounts. I vote for Option B.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Takumi,,"I'm not happy about the bonding, but I won't fight the whole group on this. I vote for Option B.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Asuka,,I vote for Option B.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
